{"seq":1,"slug":"browser-architecture","title":"浏览器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/browser-architecture","wordCount":892,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"浏览器架构\">浏览器架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>现代浏览器以<strong>多进程架构</strong>替代早期单进程模型，将 UI、网络、存储、渲染、GPU、插件等职责隔离到独立进程中；进程间通过 <strong>Mojo IPC</strong> 异步通信，渲染进程内再由主线程、合成线程、光栅化线程协同。<strong>站点隔离</strong>让不同站点运行在不同渲染进程，从操作系统层面阻断跨站数据泄露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从单进程到多进程\">从单进程到多进程</h2><p>早期浏览器（如 IE6）将所有功能集中在一个进程中运行，一个页面崩溃就会拖垮整个浏览器。现代浏览器采用 <strong>多进程架构（Multi-Process Architecture）</strong>，将不同职责拆分到独立进程中，提升稳定性、安全性和性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Browser[&quot;浏览器进程 Browser Process&quot;]&#10;        UI[&quot;UI 线程&quot;]&#10;        Network[&quot;网络线程&quot;]&#10;        Storage[&quot;存储线程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Renderer1[&quot;渲染进程 A&quot;]&#10;        Main1[&quot;主线程&quot;]&#10;        Worker1[&quot;Worker 线程&quot;]&#10;        Compositor1[&quot;合成线程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Renderer2[&quot;渲染进程 B&quot;]&#10;        Main2[&quot;主线程&quot;]&#10;        Compositor2[&quot;合成线程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GPU[&quot;GPU 进程&quot;]&#10;        GPUThread[&quot;GPU 线程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Plugin[&quot;插件进程&quot;]&#10;        PluginThread[&quot;插件线程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Browser --&gt;|IPC| Renderer1&#10;    Browser --&gt;|IPC| Renderer2&#10;    Renderer1 --&gt;|IPC| GPU&#10;    Renderer2 --&gt;|IPC| GPU&#10;    Browser --&gt;|IPC| Plugin\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Browser[\"浏览器进程 Browser Process\"]\n        UI[\"UI 线程\"]\n        Network[\"网络线程\"]\n        Storage[\"存储线程\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Renderer1[\"渲染进程 A\"]\n        Main1[\"主线程\"]\n        Worker1[\"Worker 线程\"]\n        Compositor1[\"合成线程\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Renderer2[\"渲染进程 B\"]\n        Main2[\"主线程\"]\n        Compositor2[\"合成线程\"]\n    end\n    subgraph GPU[\"GPU 进程\"]\n        GPUThread[\"GPU 线程\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Plugin[\"插件进程\"]\n        PluginThread[\"插件线程\"]\n    end\n    Browser --&gt;|IPC| Renderer1\n    Browser --&gt;|IPC| Renderer2\n    Renderer1 --&gt;|IPC| GPU\n    Renderer2 --&gt;|IPC| GPU\n    Browser --&gt;|IPC| Plugin</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心进程与职责\">核心进程与职责</h2><p>现代 Chromium 架构通常包含以下进程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>进程</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>数量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Browser Process</td>\n<td>UI 管理、导航、网络请求调度、子进程管理</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Renderer Process</td>\n<td>HTML/CSS 解析、JS 执行、页面渲染</td>\n<td>每个站点一个或多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU Process</td>\n<td>3D 绘制、合成层光栅化、视频解码加速</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network Service</td>\n<td>DNS 解析、HTTP 请求、SSL/TLS 握手</td>\n<td>1（服务化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plugin Process</td>\n<td>运行 NPAPI/PPAPI 插件（逐步淘汰）</td>\n<td>按需创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Utility Process</td>\n<td>音频服务、CDM（内容解密模块）等</td>\n<td>按需创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ChromiumProcess {&#10;  type: &#39;browser&#39; | &#39;renderer&#39; | &#39;gpu&#39; | &#39;network&#39; | &#39;plugin&#39; | &#39;utility&#39;;&#10;  pid: number;&#10;  memory: number;&#10;  cpuUsage: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function listProcesses(): ChromiumProcess[] {&#10;  const processes: ChromiumProcess[] = [];&#10;  if (&#39;process&#39; in performance) {&#10;    const metrics = (performance as any).measureUserAgentSpecificMemory();&#10;    console.log(&#39;Memory breakdown available via Performance API&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return processes;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChromiumProcess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'browser'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'renderer'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gpu'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'network'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'plugin'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'utility'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cpuUsage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> listProcesses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChromiumProcess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> processes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChromiumProcess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'process'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (performance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measureUserAgentSpecificMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Memory breakdown available via Performance API'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Chrome 中按 <code>Shift + Esc</code> 可以打开内置的任务管理器，实时查看所有进程的内存和 CPU 占用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"站点隔离-site-isolation\">站点隔离（Site Isolation）</h2><p><strong>站点隔离</strong> 是 Chrome 67 引入的关键安全特性，确保不同站点的页面运行在不同的渲染进程中。这从操作系统层面防止了恶意站点通过 Spectre 等侧信道攻击读取其他站点的数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Process1[&quot;渲染进程 1&quot;]&#10;        SiteA[&quot;site-a.com&quot;]&#10;        IframeA[&quot;site-a.com/page&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Process2[&quot;渲染进程 2&quot;]&#10;        SiteB[&quot;site-b.com (iframe)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Process3[&quot;渲染进程 3&quot;]&#10;        SiteC[&quot;site-c.com&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    SiteA -.-&gt;|跨站 iframe| SiteB&#10;    SiteA -.-&gt;|window.open| SiteC\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Process1[\"渲染进程 1\"]\n        SiteA[\"site-a.com\"]\n        IframeA[\"site-a.com/page\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Process2[\"渲染进程 2\"]\n        SiteB[\"site-b.com (iframe)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Process3[\"渲染进程 3\"]\n        SiteC[\"site-c.com\"]\n    end\n    SiteA -.-&gt;|跨站 iframe| SiteB\n    SiteA -.-&gt;|window.open| SiteC</pre><p>站点隔离的关键规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>同一站点</strong>（scheme + eTLD+1 相同）的页面共享渲染进程</li>\n<li><strong>跨站 iframe</strong> 会被分配到独立渲染进程（Out-of-Process iframes, OOPIF）</li>\n<li><code>document.domain</code> 修改不再允许跨 origin 共享进程</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const isSameSite = (urlA: string, urlB: string): boolean =&gt; {&#10;  const a = new URL(urlA);&#10;  const b = new URL(urlB);&#10;  const getETLDPlus1 = (hostname: string): string =&gt; {&#10;    const parts = hostname.split(&#39;.&#39;);&#10;    return parts.slice(-2).join(&#39;.&#39;);&#10;  };&#10;  return a.protocol === b.protocol &amp;&amp; getETLDPlus1(a.hostname) === getETLDPlus1(b.hostname);&#10;};&#10;&#10;console.log(isSameSite(&#39;https://a.example.com&#39;, &#39;https://b.example.com&#39;)); // true&#10;console.log(isSameSite(&#39;https://example.com&#39;, &#39;https://other.com&#39;)); // false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isSameSite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">urlA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">urlB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(urlA);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(urlB);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getETLDPlus1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hostname</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hostname.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.protocol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.protocol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getETLDPlus1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a.hostname) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getETLDPlus1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b.hostname);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isSameSite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://a.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://b.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isSameSite</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://other.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// false</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"进程间通信-ipc\">进程间通信（IPC）</h2><p>多进程架构依赖高效的 <strong>IPC（Inter-Process Communication）</strong> 机制。Chromium 使用 <strong>Mojo</strong> 作为其 IPC 框架，替代了早期的 Chrome IPC。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant BP as 浏览器进程&#10;    participant RP as 渲染进程&#10;    participant GP as GPU 进程&#10;&#10;    BP-&gt;&gt;RP: 导航请求 (CommitNavigation)&#10;    RP-&gt;&gt;RP: 解析 HTML / 执行 JS&#10;    RP-&gt;&gt;BP: 请求网络资源 (URLLoaderFactory)&#10;    BP--&gt;&gt;RP: 响应数据流&#10;    RP-&gt;&gt;GP: 提交合成帧 (SubmitCompositorFrame)&#10;    GP-&gt;&gt;GP: 光栅化 &amp; 合成&#10;    GP--&gt;&gt;BP: 呈现到屏幕 (SwapBuffers)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant BP as 浏览器进程\n    participant RP as 渲染进程\n    participant GP as GPU 进程\n\n    BP-&gt;&gt;RP: 导航请求 (CommitNavigation)\n    RP-&gt;&gt;RP: 解析 HTML / 执行 JS\n    RP-&gt;&gt;BP: 请求网络资源 (URLLoaderFactory)\n    BP--&gt;&gt;RP: 响应数据流\n    RP-&gt;&gt;GP: 提交合成帧 (SubmitCompositorFrame)\n    GP-&gt;&gt;GP: 光栅化 &amp; 合成\n    GP--&gt;&gt;BP: 呈现到屏幕 (SwapBuffers)</pre><p>IPC 通信的核心特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步消息</td>\n<td>非阻塞，发送方不等待响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>使用 Mojo 的 <code>mojom</code> IDL 定义接口和消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力传递</td>\n<td>通过 Message Pipe 传递句柄和权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沙箱约束</td>\n<td>渲染进程无法直接访问文件系统或网络</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface IPCMessage {&#10;  channel: string;&#10;  payload: ArrayBuffer;&#10;  transferables?: MessagePort[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const channel = new MessageChannel();&#10;const port1 = channel.port1;&#10;const port2 = channel.port2;&#10;&#10;port1.onmessage = (event: MessageEvent) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Browser process received:&#39;, event.data);&#10;};&#10;&#10;port2.postMessage({ type: &#39;RESOURCE_REQUEST&#39;, url: &#39;/api/data&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IPCMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  transferables</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessagePort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> channel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> port1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.port1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> port2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.port2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">port1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessageEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Browser process received:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">port2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESOURCE_REQUEST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"渲染进程的内部线程\">渲染进程的内部线程</h2><p>渲染进程本身也是多线程的，每个线程承担不同职责：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph RendererProcess[&quot;渲染进程&quot;]&#10;        MainThread[&quot;主线程\\n(JS 执行 / DOM 操作 / 样式计算 / 布局)&quot;]&#10;        CompositorThread[&quot;合成线程\\n(图层合成 / 滚动处理)&quot;]&#10;        RasterThread1[&quot;光栅化线程 1&quot;]&#10;        RasterThread2[&quot;光栅化线程 2&quot;]&#10;        WorkerThread[&quot;Worker 线程&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    MainThread --&gt;|提交图层树| CompositorThread&#10;    CompositorThread --&gt;|分配 tile| RasterThread1&#10;    CompositorThread --&gt;|分配 tile| RasterThread2\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph RendererProcess[\"渲染进程\"]\n        MainThread[\"主线程\\n(JS 执行 / DOM 操作 / 样式计算 / 布局)\"]\n        CompositorThread[\"合成线程\\n(图层合成 / 滚动处理)\"]\n        RasterThread1[\"光栅化线程 1\"]\n        RasterThread2[\"光栅化线程 2\"]\n        WorkerThread[\"Worker 线程\"]\n    end\n    MainThread --&gt;|提交图层树| CompositorThread\n    CompositorThread --&gt;|分配 tile| RasterThread1\n    CompositorThread --&gt;|分配 tile| RasterThread2</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>线程</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>是否阻塞页面交互</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>JS 执行、DOM/CSSOM 构建、布局、绘制</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成线程</td>\n<td>接收图层、处理滚动和动画合成</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光栅化线程</td>\n<td>将图层的 tile 转换为位图</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker 线程</td>\n<td>执行 Web Worker / Service Worker</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 动画可以完全在合成线程上运行，不会阻塞主线程，这就是它们性能更好的原因。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>现代浏览器采用<strong>多进程架构</strong>，将 Browser、Renderer、GPU、Network 等职责隔离到独立进程</li>\n<li><strong>站点隔离</strong>确保不同站点运行在不同渲染进程中，从 OS 层面阻止跨站数据泄露</li>\n<li>进程间通过 <strong>Mojo IPC</strong> 进行高效的异步消息通信</li>\n<li>渲染进程内部由<strong>主线程、合成线程、光栅化线程</strong>等多线程协同工作</li>\n<li>理解架构有助于定位性能瓶颈：主线程阻塞影响交互，合成线程处理滚动和动画</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"浏览器架构","id":"浏览器架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从单进程到多进程","id":"从单进程到多进程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心进程与职责","id":"核心进程与职责"},{"level":2,"text":"站点隔离（Site Isolation）","id":"站点隔离-site-isolation"},{"level":2,"text":"进程间通信（IPC）","id":"进程间通信-ipc"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染进程的内部线程","id":"渲染进程的内部线程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"渲染流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/rendering-pipeline"}}